DATA NOTICE:
This project uses data from the National Hospital Ambulatory Medical Care Survey
(NHAMCS) 2018-2022, made publicly available by the U.S. Centers for Disease
Control and Prevention (CDC), National Center for Health Statistics (NCHS).

NHAMCS data are in the public domain. Users of this software are responsible
for complying with the CDC/NCHS data use agreement and citing the source
appropriately in any derivative work.

Suggested citation:
  National Center for Health Statistics. National Hospital Ambulatory Medical
  Care Survey, 2018-2022. Hyattsville, MD: National Center for Health Statistics.
  https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/ahcd/index.htm
